nd Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/hughes-county"],["ARC or PLC in Hughes County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/hughes-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Hughes County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and it sat at 27% in 2025 and 18% so far in 2026. May to June is the wettest pair at 6.08 inches of normal. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1976, at 38% to 43% of normal.</p>"}
